{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03253","headline":"高山引 · 宋之问","name":"高山引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"攀云窈窕兮上跻悬峰，长路浩浩兮此去何从。\n水一曲兮肠一曲，山一重兮悲一重。\n松檟邈已远，友于何日逢？\n况满室兮童稚，攒衆虑於心胷。\n天高难诉兮远负明德，却望咸京兮挥涕龙锺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}